#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid "How can I support this project?"
msgstr "Comment puis-je soutenir ce projet ?"

#: contents/ui/configHelp.qml
msgid ""
"This plasmoid is developed and maintained on my free time. If you find it "
"useful, you can support its development:"
msgstr ""
